ted from a formulation of premium stone composite materials and 100% silica free, each bath undergoes a meticulous process, ensuring the highest standards of quality and durability. The result is a freestanding bath with a luxurious tactile finish, that not only feels exquisite but also warms quickly and helps maintains water temperature.<br/></div><div>Notes:</div><div>-Overflow &amp; waste included</div><div>-Plug &amp; Waste included as standard with bath: <a href=\"#/product/sku-sbw009-mw\"><b>SBW009/MW</b></a><br/></div></div>","sourceRecordCount":1,"captureDate":"2026-11-01","availability":null}
